<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Page not found | Grünenthal</title>

  <style>

    html {
      border: 0;
      font: inherit;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      vertical-align: baseline;
      font-family: sans-serif;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -webkit-box-sizing: border-box;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }

    body {
      border: 0;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      vertical-align: baseline;
      background: #fefefe;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.35rem;
      color: #0a0a0a;
      font-weight: 400;
      font-family: visuelt-regular, Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
    }


    h1 {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: visuelt-medium, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 4rem;
      padding: 0;
      color: #00a059;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 2.375rem;
      line-height: 2.75rem;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-family: visuelt-medium, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    a {
      border: 0;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      vertical-align: baseline;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: transparent;
      -webkit-text-decoration-skip: objects;
      font-family: visuelt-medium, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: #00a059;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: underline;
      position: relative;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    p {
      border: 0;
      font: inherit;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      vertical-align: baseline;
      margin: 0;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      line-height: 1.7rem;
    }

    a:focus {
      outline: 2px solid #00a059;
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .inner {
      max-width: 75rem;
      margin: 0 auto
    }

    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
    }

    .logo {
      margin-bottom: 100px;
    }

      .logo img {
        width: 225px;
      }

    header {
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    .error__box {
      max-width: 1000px;
    }


    @font-face {
      font-family: visuelt-medium;
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      src: url(/error/fonts/visuelt-medium.eot);
      src: url(/error/fonts/visuelt-medium.eot?#iefix) format("embedded-opentype"), url(/error/fonts/visuelt-medium.woff) format("woff"), url(/error/fonts/visuelt-medium.woff2) format("woff2"), url(/error/fonts/visuelt-medium.ttf) format("truetype");
    }

    @font-face {
      font-family: visuelt-regular;
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 400;
      src: url(/error/fonts/visuelt-regular.eot);
      src: url(/error/fonts/visuelt-regular.eot?#iefix) format("embedded-opentype"), url(/error/fonts/visuelt-regular.woff) format("woff"), url(/error/fonts/visuelt-regular.woff2) format("woff2"), url(/error/fonts/visuelt-regular.ttf) format("truetype");
    }
  </style>

</head>
<body>
  <div class="error_page" role="main" aria-labelledby="error-title">
    <div class="inner">
      <header class="logo">
        <a title="Grünenthal Homepage" href="/" aria-label="Go to Grünenthal homepage">
          <img src="/error/logo-grunenthal--dark.svg" alt="Grünenthal Logo">
        </a>
      </header>
      <main>
        <section class="error__container">
          <h1 id="error-title">Error 404</h1>
          <div class="error__box">
            <h2>Page Not Found</h2>
            <p>
              We can’t seem to find the page you are looking for. The requested page/URL was not found on the server. <br>
              It probably no longer exists, or it was a typing mistake. <br>
              If you have entered the URL manually, please check the spelling and try again.
            </p>
            <p>
              If you consider this to be a server malfunction or need information about Grünenthal, please contact <a title="Grünenthal's general contact" aria-label="Send an email to Grünenthal's general contact info@grunenthal.com" href="mailto:info@grunenthal.com">info@grunenthal.com</a>. <br>
              Product-related questions can be addressed to <a title="Product inquiries" aria-label="Send an email to product inquiries at mim@grunenthal.com" href="mailto:mim@grunenthal.com">mim@grunenthal.com</a>. <br>
              If you wish to report an adverse event, please email <a title="Grünenthal drug safety" aria-label="Send an email to report an adverse event to drugsafety@grunenthal.com" href="mailto:drugsafety@grunenthal.com">drugsafety@grunenthal.com</a>.
            </p>
            <p>We are sorry for this inconvenience!</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>